'''Battle:''' While this might seem really easy to pull off, you need to continuously spam Royal Guards when they're off cooldown. Hesitating will result in your Guards not juggling Puffsley, and Puffsley will attack your Guard stack and cause you to lose. Spamming Guards is already a massive cash drain, so there's really no recovering from this occuring. When done correctly, the Guards will continuously juggle Puffsley while he's at the base and kill him with ease, and then obliterate the base soon after.

